        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for raptor fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2024-57823: Fixed integer underflow when normalizing a URI with the turtle parser (bsc#1235673).\n- CVE-2024-57822: Fixed heap buffer overread when parsing triples with the nquads parser (bsc#1235674).\n",
